  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "水環境低碳綠能規劃",
    "sub_ename": "PLANNING OF WATER ENVIRONMENT WITH LOW-CARBON AND GREEN ENERGY",
    "describe_ch": "因應近年水環境逐漸轉向低碳與綠能等議題，本課程提供水環境低碳與綠能規劃相關知識與技術，包含小水力發電與工程碳排估算等知識與技術，讓同學瞭解水利最新議題，並培養修課學生未來就業能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Due to the growing emphasis on low-carbon and green energy initiatives in water management in recent years, this course introduces the knowledge and technology of planning of low-carbon and green energy water environment. The course provides the knowledge and technology on small hydropower and carbon emission estimation. This course allows students to understand the latest issues in water conservancy and cultivate their future employment skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
